      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Absolutely agree with this. A lot of the roleplay community has specific character heights and getting to the exact one you need on the radial menu to be able to set off other animations can be tedious especially with an Index joystick and slightly shaky hands.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
